# exact_def_call_authority — ExactDef 批 5: var-out 分类器 + 调用权威三族 +
# seal root 校验 + 程序契约 (docs/cheng-exact-def-rewrite-design.md §4 批 5 /
# §5-1/§5-4/§3.4/§6; 算法照 docs/cheng-exact-def-batch5-authority-spec.md
# 全条款按 Cheng 基板重证, C 行号证据逐条锚定在注释中:
# 分类器 cold_parser.c:25499-26660, 发布器三族 28436-29652, 墙3 store 爬升
# 82776-82926, seal/canonical root 55679-56529, 契约 derive/admit
# cheng_cold.c:104235-10618)。
#
# 职责 (规格 §1-§4, §6 重证要点):
#   1. var-out 分类器五物理形态重证 (规格 §6「五种写回物理形态逐形态重证」):
#      Cheng 无 NOP/MEMORY_VERSION op 行, 写回定义的 C 版本行身份由 place 车
#     道 MV 戳承载 (夹具戳注入; 生产 lowering 物化发戳属批 6 锚点 — 批 2
#      reissue 循环 4 [reissuefail] 车道届时同行解锚, 本批不动)。五形态:
#      ①CopyLocal/StoreLocal 写回 (≈C LOCAL_ADDR 载体形) ②FieldStore/
#      IndexedStore 投影写回 (≈C projection 载体形) ③sret forward (≈C
#      forwarded COPY_I64 形, 含全局投影根) ④out 直写 (≈C var_array_local
#      形) ⑤投影 publication (≈C 第五分类两行组, 投影槽行+根 cell 行发布
#      组, 时序约束转空间约束 — 同调用同形参, 根行物理居后, 批 4 §4 同
#      款)。(call, formal, carrier) 三元组空间回收: 从 def 同块倒扫最近
#      持有该 cell 实参 (地址编码或值编码) 的 CallOp 得 (call, formal);
#      carrier=调用前该 cell 当前定义 (发射序末定义+reaches 证明); 发布
#      组根行的 carrier=同组投影行。判词: index structure 八字段 /
#      authority mismatch 九字段逐字 (C 25744/26408); 主审 MV 臂包装判词
#      `call memory version is broken call formal carrier` (cheng_cold.c:
#      68841 逐字, identity schema 行前缀同批 3 各臂)。
#   2. 调用权威三族 (发布器 28436-29652 的 Cheng 只校验面): 逐 CallOp 逐
#      var 形参实参 (argPassKinds∈{ParamAddress, ForwardEntrySret} 可变地
#      址车道) 分派 — 全局臂 (GlobalLoad+GLOBAL+SHARED+consume==0+live
#      before call, C 28389-28434) / shared-borrow 臂 (判词分流器非放行
#      路径, C 28900-28914 同构: 载体检随后无条件第二判词) / 投影实参臂
#      (unique 投影根+活性+未触, C 28915-29031) / W8 unique-borrow 臂
#      (reaches+current+live+权威四析取, C 29032-29090/22325-22470)。未
#      初始化源形 (C 26439-26447): 无当前定义且 [0,def) 无该 cell 定义
#      → 承认 (同族锚定)。可变性门 `call var-out actual is not a mutable
#      stack local` 真空锚定 (BodyIR 无 is_mutable 列, let-bound var 实参
#      由 TypedExpr 拒, C 28666-28716 注释即此裁定); `call var-out
#      definition state is invalid` 真空锚定 (无解析期状态机)。
#   3. @borrow_result var root 臂 (C 28721-28863/24468-24724): 契约合取
#      (FORMAL+singleton+mask+global==-1+READ_ONLY_PROVEN) 成立后三载体
#      形 (local-address/forwarded var param/exact projection) + 身份链
#      + reaches 双链 + source[call]==carrier 全证, 不过 → die 判词逐字。
#      生产触发真空锚定: CallOp 无 callee int32 行键 (契约表按函数行索
#      引) 且 compiler_csg 全程序 seal 接线属后续锚点 — 本批为单位级校
#      验器 (夹具显式驱动), 非降级旁路 (无表即无 FORMAL 根契约正证据,
#      W8 臂活性/权威合取仍全量适用; ColdBorrowResultContractProbe 降
#      级旁路不移植, 规格 §7)。
#   4. 墙3 store 爬升 (C 82776-82926): FieldStore/IndexedStore 托管基座
#      (storage∈{STR,SEQUENCE,OBJECT}) 的 base 权威 — owned 基座槽约定
#      臂直收 (C 82847-82860 同族, 批 3 根门已审); CFG_MERGE 基座批 4
#      主审域; 借用基座 (BS/BU) 走 owner 链终态闭包 (帧自有/PARAM+边/
#      GLOBAL/owned 构造四终态 — 帧自有谓词批 3 单实现同源第四处接线,
#      C 82839-82841), 不过 → die `indexed element field store lacks
#      exact unique base authority` 逐字。MV 纪元爬升真空 (无 MV 生产车
#      道, C 82813-82877 的 64 跳爬升载体不存在 — 其语义由批 2 活性车
#     道与批 5 owner 终态闭包结构性覆盖)。
#   5. seal/canonical root 只校验不重走 (规格 §3.3, 设计 §5-4): 每托管
#      借用定义行的 borrow-owner 三元组冻结列逐行核 — domain 合法 /
#      ownerRow 行域内 / 单调无环 (owner<dependent, TypedExpr 冻结列保
#      证, 深度预算结构性多余不移植) / owner 链终态闭包 (PARAM 物化 /
#      GLOBAL / owned 本地构造 PLAIN|MOVE 三终态; 借用构造无终态 →
#      panic hard fail, C 56039 return -1 同族) / 标量与序列槽不成根
#      (C §3.1-6 白名单 {OBJECT,STR,OBJECT_REF,STR_REF} → 终态 storage
#      ∈{OBJECT,STR}, 规格 §3.3-4)。违上游不变式 = panic 单行确定
#      (Let it crash, 非夹具判词)。merge 双输入 owner 同一物理行 = 批 4
#      主审域 (borrow 根冻结三列逐值相等), 本层不重检。
#   6. 程序契约表推导 (规格 §4.5, 不重建 FunctionContractAdmission 状
#      态机): TypedExpr 冻结列投影窗直读 (resultExprClasses/RET owner
#      域窗/形参与全局 TypeId 窗/read-only 证据窗 — §2.3 四拒绝集的
#      TypedExpr 侧重述在 compiler_csg 接线时填窗, manualConsume* 投
#      影), 逐函数推五槽 + 快照窗恒等校验 (§4.2-7), reject 文本沿用 C
#      (FunctionContractAdmission [%s] row=%d reject: %s 形, die 语义 —
#      C cold_function_contract_reject 103289-103315: stderr 单行 + 进
#      程退出)。`borrow-result callee graph contains a cycle` 真空不移植
#      (TypedExpr owner 行单调结构性排除, 规格 §4.5)。
#
# Cheng 基板差异裁定 (规格 §6, 逐条在对应处注释):
#   - 证书位 (exact_var_provenance_certificates) 无对应物 — 语义=「本行
#     已过分类器」, 由单遍归纳顺序替代 (先证先行, C 26833-26837 注释同
#     族); verify 模式判词 `frozen exact var provenance certificate
#     drifted` 真空不移植。memo 层 (键域 1/2/3/4) 不移植 — 单遍顺序推
#     导天然归纳, 递归深度=发布组内物理序 (op 严格递减由空间约束保证)。
#   - 探针 ([vo*]/[pub]/[iba*]/[mv]/[oxa*]/[ux*]/[cr*]/[br*]/[ret]/
#     [x22] 等) 与 env 门 (CHENG_COLD_DUMP_BODYIR/CHENG_OXA_DIAG/
#     CHENG_COLD_DUMP_VAR_FORWARD) 不移植 (规格 §7 清单)。
#   - 判词文本逐字保留 C (含 cheng_cold: 前缀与字段序); 基板替换仅
#     %.*s 函数名 → controlFunctionRow int32 (批 1-4 先例); 契约 reject
#     行取无 fn 段形 (C 无 symbols 分支同形 — Cheng 程序级无函数名权
#     威)。诊断块 (nearby-op dump/consumer dump/三组诊断行/env 判词)
#     不移植 (规格 §6 末段口径)。
#   - 生产触发面: MV 分类器/写回重证 = 真空直通 (无 MV 生产车道, 批 4
#     零请求同例); 三族+墙3+seal 校验 = 生产实发 (键在 call-arg CSR
#     侧车列/argPassKinds 结构列/冻结 borrow-owner 列); 相位级入口
#     (ExactDefCallAuthorityPhaseValidateInto) 是分类器的校验面, 组合
#     入口 (ExactDefCallAuthorityValidateInto) 是两后端生产挂接点
#     (primary_object_plan/backend2_pipeline 同口径)。
#
# 身份纪律: 一切跨节点身份 int32 行 (op 行/槽行/块行/TypeId/函数行),
# 零文本零名字键 (判词投影段除外 — 单行确定性强排投影)。

import std/strformat
import std/os
import cheng/core/ir/core_types as coreir
import cheng/core/ir/body_ir_exact_def as exactdef
import cheng/core/analysis/exact_def_freeze as freeze
import cheng/core/analysis/exact_def_merge as exactdefmerge
import cheng/core/analysis/exact_def_identity as identity
import cheng/core/lang/typed_expr_type_arena as typearena
import cheng/std/bytes_layout as layout
import cheng/std/crypto/hash256

const
    # var-out 五物理形态 tag (规格 §6 五写回形)。
    ExactDefCallAuthorityFormNone = 0
    ExactDefCallAuthorityFormCopyLocalWriteback = 1
    ExactDefCallAuthorityFormProjectionWriteback = 2
    ExactDefCallAuthorityFormSretForward = 3
    ExactDefCallAuthorityFormOutDirect = 4
    ExactDefCallAuthorityFormProjectionPublication = 5
    # texpr.TypedExprExprClass 值镜 (typed_expr.cheng:35-39; 契约推导
    # 的 resultExprClasses 投影窗按此域解释, 本模块不 import typed_expr)。
    exactDefCallAuthorityExprClassUnknown = 0
    exactDefCallAuthorityExprClassOwned = 1
    exactDefCallAuthorityExprClassBorrowed = 2
    exactDefCallAuthorityExprClassUnmanaged = 3
    # 契约推导 RET owner 域窗值 (§4.5 物化 owner 域的窗编码)。
    exactDefCallAuthorityRetRootStatic = 0
    exactDefCallAuthorityRetRootFormal = 1
    exactDefCallAuthorityRetRootGlobal = 2
    exactDefCallAuthorityRetRootOther = 3
    exactDefCallAuthorityRetRootSentinel = -1

type
    # var-out 定义现场 (call/formal/carrier 三元组空间回收结果;
    # C NOP 行 (dst=value_slot, a=call, b=param, c=carrier) tuple 的
    # Cheng 回收形)。publicationCarrier=发布组投影行 (第五形态),
    # -1 非发布形; source=opSourceDefRow 直读。
    ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite =
        definition: int32
        valueSlot: int32
        callOp: int32
        callRow: int32
        param: int32
        argRow: int32
        carrier: int32
        publicationCarrier: int32
        source: int32
        form: int32

# ---- verdict / die 基座 (批 2-4 同铭文) ----

@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityVerdictEmit(line: str) =
    os.WriteLine(os.Get_stderr(), line)
    os.C_fflush(os.Get_stderr())

# C die 语义 (发布器三族/墙3/契约 reject): stderr 单行确定 + 进程退出,
# 不返 (cheng_cold.c:296, 批 2-4 同铭文)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityDie(line: str) =
    os.WriteLine(os.Get_stderr(), line)
    os.C_fflush(os.Get_stderr())
    os.os_exit_bridge(2)

fn exactDefCallAuthorityBoolInt(value: bool): int32 =
    if value:
        return 1
    return 0

@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityOpOperandOrInvalid(op: coreir.BodyOp,
                                           ordinal: int32): int32 =
    if ordinal < 0 || ordinal >= op.operands.len:
        return -1
    return op.operands[ordinal]

# ---- 判词文本构建器 (C 文本逐字保留, 含 cheng_cold: 前缀与字段序;
#      基板替换: %.*s 函数名 → controlFunctionRow int32, 批 1-4 先例) ----

# index structure 八字段 (C cold_parser.c:25744 逐字; 字段按 Cheng 回收
# 形态填: carrier 族列 (ckind/cdst/ca/csrc) 由回收的 carrier 行直读,
# 未回收段 -1, 设计 §6「重证后按 Cheng 形态填字段」)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityIndexStructureLine(definition: int32,
                                           call: int32,
                                           carrier: int32,
                                           slot: int32,
                                           ckind: int32,
                                           cdst: int32,
                                           ca: int32,
                                           csrc: int32): str =
    return Fmt"cheng_cold: call var-out definition index structure mismatch definition={definition} call={call} carrier={carrier} slot={slot} ckind={ckind} cdst={cdst} ca={ca} csrc={csrc}"

# authority mismatch 九字段 (C cold_parser.c:26408 逐字; 三组诊断块不
# 移植, 规格 §6 末段口径)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchLine(definition: int32,
                                     source: int32,
                                     callArg: int32,
                                     formal: int32,
                                     valueSlot: int32,
                                     exactType: int32,
                                     storage: int32,
                                     sentinel: int32,
                                     sourceMatch: int32): str =
    return Fmt"cheng_cold: call var-out definition authority mismatch definition={definition} source={source} call_arg={callArg} formal={formal} value_slot={valueSlot} exact_type={exactType} storage={storage} sentinel={sentinel} source_match={sourceMatch}"

# 主审 MEMORY_VERSION var-out 臂包装判词 (cheng_cold.c:68841 逐字,
# identity schema 行前缀同批 3 各臂; call/formal/carrier 按 Cheng 回收
# 形态填, 未回收段 -1)。STACK_LOCAL NOP 形非 borrow-result 版本的
# `call var-out definition is broken` (68896) 同字段序 — Cheng 无
# STACK_LOCAL NOP 载体, 两形统一走本包装 (锚定注释)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityMemoryVersionBrokenLine(phase: str,
                                                functionRow: int32,
                                                opRow: int32,
                                                call: int32,
                                                formal: int32,
                                                carrier: int32): str =
    return Fmt"cheng_cold: exact identity schema [{phase}] fn={functionRow} op row={opRow} call memory version is broken call={call} formal={formal} carrier={carrier}"

# 契约 reject (C cold_function_contract_reject 103289-103315 的 stderr
# 单行形; 取无 fn 段形 — Cheng 程序级无函数名权威, 批 1-4 基板替换同
# 例; reject 后随 die 语义 = stderr 单行 + 进程退出)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityContractRejectLine(phase: str,
                                           functionRow: int32,
                                           reason: str): str =
    return Fmt"cheng_cold: FunctionContractAdmission [{phase}] row={functionRow} reject: {reason}"

# str[] 字面量借用元素判词 (批 6 W6 族, cold_parser.c:42692-42710 逐字;
# body=%.*s → controlFunctionRow, 批 1-5 先例; place/origin 车道在
# lowering 触发点未落 → 触发侧按 Cheng 形态填 -1, 设计 §6 注)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityStrSeqLiteralOwnershipLine(body: int32,
                                                   element: int32,
                                                   def: int32,
                                                   ownership: int32,
                                                   place: int32,
                                                   origin: int32,
                                                   kind: int32,
                                                   slot: int32,
                                                   source: int32,
                                                   opA: int32,
                                                   opB: int32,
                                                   opC: int32): str =
    return Fmt"cheng_cold: str[] literal ownership body={body} element={element} def={def} ownership={ownership} place={place} origin={origin} kind={kind} slot={slot} source={source} op_a={opA} op_b={opB} op_c={opC}"

# W6 die (两行同序: 全字段 fprintf + die 文本逐字; C 侧验证器只验戳
# 不豁免 — 借用元素未持 owned 值必拒, 规格 §7-5)。触发点: str 序
# 列字面量元素物化臂 (primary_object_plan/backend2_lower_slots 的
# AppendSeqLiteralToSlot str 元素分支)。
@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityStrSeqBorrowedElementReject(body: int32,
                                                    element: int32,
                                                    def: int32,
                                                    ownership: int32,
                                                    place: int32,
                                                    origin: int32,
                                                    kind: int32,
                                                    slot: int32,
                                                    source: int32,
                                                    opA: int32,
                                                    opB: int32,
                                                    opC: int32) =
    exactDefCallAuthorityVerdictEmit(
        exactDefCallAuthorityStrSeqLiteralOwnershipLine(
            body, element, def, ownership, place, origin, kind, slot,
            source, opA, opB, opC))
    exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
        "str[] literal borrowed element requires an explicit owned value")

# ---- 基元: source 列 / 槽类型 / 活性 / 当前定义回收 ----

@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityOpSourceDefRow(op: coreir.BodyOp): int32 =
    return freeze.ExactDefFreezeIdentityOpSourceDefRow(op)

@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityDefSlotOrInvalid(bodyIR: coreir.BodyIR,
                                         def: int32): int32 =
    if def < 0 || def >= bodyIR.ops.len:
        return -1
    return bodyIR.ops[def].valueDefSlot

@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityOwnershipIsBorrow(ownership: int32): bool =
    return ownership == Int32(coreir.OwnBorrowShared) ||
           ownership == Int32(coreir.OwnBorrowUnique)

@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthoritySlotManagedStorage(bodyIR: coreir.BodyIR,
                                           slot: int32): bool =
    if slot < 0 || slot >= bodyIR.localSlots.len:
        return false
    let storage = bodyIR.exactDef.slotStorageKinds[slot]
    return storage == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefStorageStrTag ||
           storage == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefStorageSequenceTag ||
           storage == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefStorageObjectTag

# 调用前某 cell 当前定义回收: 发射序倒扫首个 reaches beforeOp 的同槽
# 定义 (发射序末定义+到达证明; 无文本无名字, 与批 1 derive 的
# lastDefOpBySlot 同证据类的冻结层对应物)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityCurrentDefBefore(
        bodyIR: coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        opBlockIds: int32[],
        slot: int32,
        beforeOp: int32): int32 =
    var candidate = beforeOp - 1
    while candidate >= 0:
        if bodyIR.ops[candidate].valueDefSlot == slot &&
           freeze.ExactDefFreezeIdentityReaches(
               bodyIR, dom, opBlockIds, candidate, beforeOp):
            return candidate
        candidate = candidate - 1
    return -1

# 借用 owner 链终态闭包 (seal/canonical root §3.3 只校验不重走的消费
# 者形): 沿冻结 borrow-owner 列走 (BodyOp 域严格递减, TypedExpr 冻结
# 列保证单调无环; 预算=op 计数, 结构性多余仅作硬界), 终态四析取:
# 帧自有 (批 3 单实现同源) / PARAM+定义边 / GLOBAL / owned 本地构造
# (own∈{PLAIN,MOVE})。wantUnique=true 要求 BU 唯一链 (墙3 unique 臂);
# false 承认 SHARED 链的帧自有根 (墙3 第一跳, C 82839-82841)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityBorrowTerminalRootValid(
        bodyIR: coreir.BodyIR,
        definition: int32,
        wantUnique: bool): bool =
    if definition < 0 || definition >= bodyIR.ops.len:
        return false
    var walk = definition
    var budget = bodyIR.ops.len + 1
    while budget > 0:
        budget = budget - 1
        let op = bodyIR.ops[walk]
        let ownership = Int32(op.valueDefOwnership)
        let domain = op.valueDefBorrowOwnerDefinitionDomain
        if domain == coreir.BodyDefinitionDomainBodyOpTag:
            let owner = op.valueDefBorrowOwnerDefinitionRow
            if owner < 0 || owner >= walk:
                return false
            walk = owner
            continue
        if domain == coreir.BodyDefinitionDomainEntrySlotTag:
            let ownerSlot = op.valueDefBorrowOwnerDefinitionRow
            if ownerSlot < 0 || ownerSlot >= bodyIR.localSlots.len:
                return false
            # EntrySlot 终态: 形参物化 (entry 车道) 或全局地址槽。
            for ordinal in 0..<bodyIR.entryParameterSlotIds.len:
                if bodyIR.entryParameterSlotIds[ordinal] == ownerSlot:
                    return true
            return bodyIR.localSlots[ownerSlot].placeKind ==
                   coreir.BodyPlaceGlobalAddressTag
        # 无 owner 三元 → 本行即终态候选。
        if identity.ExactDefIdentityDefinitionRootsFrameOwnedSlot(
               bodyIR, walk):
            return true
        let place = bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[walk]
        if place == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceParamTag:
            if wantUnique && ownership != Int32(coreir.OwnBorrowUnique):
                return false
            return freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityParamDefinitionEdgeValid(
                bodyIR, walk)
        if place == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceGlobalTag:
            return true
        if ownership == Int32(coreir.OwnPlain) ||
           ownership == Int32(coreir.OwnMove):
            # owned 本地构造终态 (C §3.1-9 PLAIN|MOVE)。
            return place == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceStackLocalTag ||
                   place == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceTemporaryTag
        return false
    return false

# ---- var-out 分类器 (规格 §1/§6 五物理形态重证) ----

# (call, formal, argRow) 空间回收: def 同块倒扫最近持有该 cell 实参
# (地址编码 CallArgSlotAddress 或值编码) 的 CallOp。C NOP 行 op_a/op_b
# 两列在 Cheng 无载体 — 由空间不变量回收 (批 4 §6.1 同款); 块门同 C
# 26400-26409 (REF 载体瞬态行必须与调用同块; out 直写豁免锚定 —
# 夹具同块形, 跨块载体=活性由初始化源证, 生产真空)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutRecover(
        bodyIR: coreir.BodyIR,
        opBlockIds: int32[],
        definition: int32,
        site: var ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite): bool =
    site.definition = definition
    site.valueSlot = -1
    site.callOp = -1
    site.callRow = -1
    site.param = -1
    site.argRow = -1
    site.carrier = -1
    site.publicationCarrier = -1
    site.source = -1
    site.form = ExactDefCallAuthorityFormNone
    if definition < 0 || definition >= bodyIR.ops.len:
        return false
    let op = bodyIR.ops[definition]
    site.valueSlot = op.valueDefSlot
    site.source = exactDefCallAuthorityOpSourceDefRow(op)
    if site.valueSlot < 0 || site.valueSlot >= bodyIR.localSlots.len:
        return false
    let block = opBlockIds[definition]
    if block < 0:
        return false
    let blockStart = bodyIR.blocks[block].opStart
    var candidate = definition - 1
    while candidate >= blockStart:
        let candidateOp = bodyIR.ops[candidate]
        if candidateOp.kind == coreir.BodyOpCallTag &&
           candidateOp.operands.len == 1:
            let callRow = candidateOp.operands[0]
            if callRow >= 0 && callRow < bodyIR.callSequence.len:
                let call = bodyIR.callSequence[callRow]
                var argIndex: int32
                while argIndex < call.argSlots.len:
                    let encoded = call.argSlots[argIndex]
                    if (coreir.CallArgSlotIsAddress(encoded) &&
                        coreir.CallArgSlotAddressId(encoded) ==
                            site.valueSlot) ||
                       encoded == site.valueSlot:
                        site.callOp = candidate
                        site.callRow = callRow
                        site.param = argIndex
                        site.argRow =
                            bodyIR.exactDef.callArgStarts[callRow] +
                                argIndex
                        return true
                    argIndex = argIndex + 1
        candidate = candidate - 1
    # 直参回收失败 → 发布组根行候选: 同块倒扫最近 MV 行 (物理居前),
    # 其 cell 的实参回收即根行的 (call, formal) (C 第五分类: 根行的
    # carrier 就是同调用同形参的投影发布行)。
    candidate = definition - 1
    while candidate >= blockStart:
        if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[candidate] ==
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceMemoryVersionTag &&
           bodyIR.ops[candidate].valueDefSlot >= 0 &&
           bodyIR.ops[candidate].valueDefSlot != site.valueSlot:
            var projectionSite: ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite
            if exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutRecover(
                   bodyIR, opBlockIds, candidate, projectionSite):
                # 发布组空间约束: 投影行物理居调用之后、根行之前
                # (同调用同形参, 批 4 §4 时序转空间同款)。
                if candidate > projectionSite.callOp:
                    site.callOp = projectionSite.callOp
                    site.callRow = projectionSite.callRow
                    site.param = projectionSite.param
                    site.argRow = projectionSite.argRow
                    site.publicationCarrier = candidate
                    return true
            return false
        candidate = candidate - 1
    return false

# 载体权威析取 (C local_addr/projection/forwarded 载体形的 Cheng 单判 —
# 规格 §6-1「哨兵载体与 initialized 投影的 split 转载体定义行存在且过
# 投影权威单判」): 帧自有 / PARAM+定义边 / 投影载体 (投影 op 集+
# BORROW_PROJECTION place+借用根冻结权威) / 全局根 (GLOBAL place 的
# GlobalLoad, 全局臂权威在调用权威族全证, 分类器侧载体形承认)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityCarrierAuthorityValid(
        bodyIR: coreir.BodyIR,
        carrier: int32): bool =
    if carrier < 0 || carrier >= bodyIR.ops.len:
        return false
    if identity.ExactDefIdentityDefinitionRootsFrameOwnedSlot(
           bodyIR, carrier):
        return true
    if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[carrier] ==
           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceParamTag:
        return freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityParamDefinitionEdgeValid(
            bodyIR, carrier)
    if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[carrier] ==
           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceGlobalTag:
        return bodyIR.ops[carrier].kind == coreir.BodyOpGlobalLoadTag
    if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[carrier] ==
           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceBorrowProjectionTag:
        let op = bodyIR.ops[carrier]
        let projectionKind = op.kind == coreir.BodyOpFieldLoadTag ||
            op.kind == coreir.BodyOpIndexedLoadTag ||
            op.kind == coreir.BodyOpResultProjectTag
        return projectionKind &&
               freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityBorrowResultRootValid(
                   bodyIR, carrier)
    return false

# 八字段 index structure 判词发射 (字段按 Cheng 回收形态填, 未回收段
# -1; carrier 族列由 carrier 行直读)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityIndexStructureEmit(
        bodyIR: coreir.BodyIR,
        site: ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite): bool =
    var carrierKind: int32 = -1
    var carrierDst: int32 = -1
    var carrierA: int32 = -1
    var carrierSource: int32 = -1
    if site.carrier >= 0 && site.carrier < bodyIR.ops.len:
        let carrierOp = bodyIR.ops[site.carrier]
        carrierKind = carrierOp.kind
        carrierDst = carrierOp.valueDefSlot
        carrierA = exactDefCallAuthorityOpOperandOrInvalid(carrierOp, 0)
        carrierSource = exactDefCallAuthorityOpSourceDefRow(carrierOp)
    exactDefCallAuthorityVerdictEmit(
        exactDefCallAuthorityIndexStructureLine(
            site.definition, site.callOp, site.carrier, site.valueSlot,
            carrierKind, carrierDst, carrierA, carrierSource))
    return false

# 九字段 authority mismatch 判词发射。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
        bodyIR: coreir.BodyIR,
        site: ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite,
        exactType: int32,
        storage: int32,
        sentinel: int32,
        sourceMatch: int32): bool =
    exactDefCallAuthorityVerdictEmit(
        exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchLine(
            site.definition, site.source, site.argRow, site.param,
            site.valueSlot, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch))
    return false

# 形态分类 (规格 §6 五形; carrier=调用前当前定义回收)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutClassify(
        bodyIR: coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        opBlockIds: int32[],
        site: var ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite): bool =
    let op = bodyIR.ops[site.definition]
    let call = bodyIR.callSequence[site.callRow]
    if site.publicationCarrier >= 0:
        site.form = ExactDefCallAuthorityFormProjectionPublication
        return true
    let encoded = call.argSlots[site.param]
    let valueEncoded = encoded == site.valueSlot
    let storeForm = op.kind == coreir.BodyOpFieldStoreTag ||
        op.kind == coreir.BodyOpIndexedStoreTag
    let copyForm = op.kind == coreir.BodyOpCopyLocalTag ||
        op.kind == coreir.BodyOpStoreLocalTag
    site.carrier = exactDefCallAuthorityCurrentDefBefore(
        bodyIR, dom, opBlockIds, site.valueSlot, site.callOp)
    if storeForm:
        site.form = ExactDefCallAuthorityFormProjectionWriteback
        return site.carrier >= 0
    if copyForm:
        if site.carrier < 0:
            return true
        # out 直写 (≈C var_array_local): 值编码实参+CSR 四列==数组本地
        # 当前定义四列+定长数组结构 (无地址载体行)。
        if valueEncoded &&
           site.argRow >= 0 &&
           site.argRow < bodyIR.exactDef.argDefOpRows.len &&
           bodyIR.exactDef.argDefOpRows[site.argRow] == site.carrier &&
           bodyIR.exactDef.argOwnerships[site.argRow] ==
               Int32(bodyIR.ops[site.carrier].valueDefOwnership) &&
           bodyIR.exactDef.argPlaceKinds[site.argRow] ==
               bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[site.carrier] &&
           bodyIR.exactDef.argOriginIds[site.argRow] ==
               bodyIR.exactDef.opOriginIds[site.carrier]:
            let slotType =
                bodyIR.localSlots[site.valueSlot].typeArenaTypeId
            if slotType >= 0 &&
               freeze.ExactDefFreezeTypeFactStructuralKind(
                   bodyIR, slotType) ==
                   Int32(typearena.TypedExprStructuralTypeFixedArray):
                site.form = ExactDefCallAuthorityFormOutDirect
                return true
        # sret forward (≈C forwarded COPY_I64): 载体是不可变借用定义
        # (PARAM+BORROW_UNIQUE+定义边) 或全局投影根。
        if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[site.carrier] ==
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceParamTag &&
           bodyIR.ops[site.carrier].valueDefOwnership ==
               coreir.OwnBorrowUnique &&
           freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityParamDefinitionEdgeValid(
               bodyIR, site.carrier):
            site.form = ExactDefCallAuthorityFormSretForward
            return true
        if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[site.carrier] ==
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceGlobalTag &&
           bodyIR.ops[site.carrier].kind == coreir.BodyOpGlobalLoadTag:
            site.form = ExactDefCallAuthorityFormSretForward
            return true
        # CopyLocal 写回 (≈C LOCAL_ADDR 载体形)。
        if exactDefCallAuthorityCarrierAuthorityValid(bodyIR, site.carrier):
            site.form = ExactDefCallAuthorityFormCopyLocalWriteback
            return true
        return false
    return false

# 未初始化源形 (C 26439-26447 同构): call-arg sentinel (地址实参 CSR
# 无定义行) 且 [0,definition) 内无任何该 cell 定义 → 承认 (def 即首
# 个版本)。Cheng 地址实参 CSR 车道 = derive 车道事实 (def=-1)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityUninitializedSourceValid(
        bodyIR: coreir.BodyIR,
        site: ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite): bool =
    if site.argRow < 0 || site.argRow >= bodyIR.exactDef.argDefOpRows.len:
        return false
    if bodyIR.exactDef.argDefOpRows[site.argRow] >= 0:
        return false
    for opRow in 0..<site.definition:
        if bodyIR.ops[opRow].valueDefSlot == site.valueSlot:
            return false
    return true

# sret forward 的 consume 四析取 (C 26068-26123 重证, 转批 2 consume
# 通道直读): 空 / 本行 (==def+1) / 互斥对 / other_slot。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityForwardedConsumeValid(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        workspace: var freeze.ExactDefFreezeWorkspace,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        site: ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite): bool =
    let consumePlusOne =
        bodyIR.ops[site.carrier].valueDefConsumeOpIndexPlusOne
    if consumePlusOne == 0:
        return true
    if consumePlusOne == site.definition + 1:
        return true
    let consumer = consumePlusOne - 1
    if consumer < 0 || consumer >= bodyIR.ops.len:
        return false
    if !freeze.ExactDefFreezeIdentityOpConsumesDefinition(
           bodyIR, site.carrier, consumer):
        # other_slot: 记录消费者消费的是他槽定义 (跨槽谱系走 origin/
        # source 列, C 29636-29641 注释同族)。
        return true
    return freeze.ExactDefFreezeMergeMutuallyExclusiveConsumerPairValid(
        bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, site.carrier, consumer,
        site.definition)

# 严格合取 (C 26237-26277 cid gate 的 Cheng 重证, 全形态共段 +
# 形态特化段)。失败 → 九字段判词。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutAuthorityValid(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        workspace: var freeze.ExactDefFreezeWorkspace,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        site: ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite): bool =
    let op = bodyIR.ops[site.definition]
    let call = bodyIR.callSequence[site.callRow]
    let exactType = bodyIR.exactDef.opExactTypeIds[site.definition]
    let slotType = bodyIR.localSlots[site.valueSlot].typeArenaTypeId
    let storage = bodyIR.exactDef.slotStorageKinds[site.valueSlot]
    let ownership = Int32(op.valueDefOwnership)
    # formal var 证据 (可变地址车道; out 直写形另收 by-address 聚合
    # 车道 — var T[N] 按引用传)。
    var passKind: int32 = -1
    if site.param >= 0 && site.param < call.argPassKinds.len:
        passKind = call.argPassKinds[site.param]
    var formalVar = passKind == coreir.BodyCallPassParamAddressTag ||
        passKind == coreir.BodyCallPassForwardEntrySretTag
    if !formalVar &&
       site.form == ExactDefCallAuthorityFormOutDirect &&
       passKind == coreir.BodyCallPassByAddressAggregateTag:
        formalVar = true
    # CSR sentinel / source-match 车道 (判词字段投影; 地址实参恒
    # sentinel 车道 — derive 车道事实, 值实参四列==carrier 即
    # matches_exact_carrier, C 26007-26037 三车道)。
    var sentinel = 0
    var sourceMatch = 0
    if site.argRow >= 0 && site.argRow < bodyIR.exactDef.argDefOpRows.len:
        if bodyIR.exactDef.argDefOpRows[site.argRow] < 0:
            sentinel = 1
        elif site.carrier >= 0 &&
             bodyIR.exactDef.argDefOpRows[site.argRow] == site.carrier &&
             bodyIR.exactDef.argOwnerships[site.argRow] ==
                 Int32(bodyIR.ops[site.carrier].valueDefOwnership) &&
             bodyIR.exactDef.argPlaceKinds[site.argRow] ==
                 bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[site.carrier] &&
             bodyIR.exactDef.argOriginIds[site.argRow] ==
                 bodyIR.exactDef.opOriginIds[site.carrier]:
            sourceMatch = 1
    if !formalVar || exactType < 0 || slotType != exactType ||
       storage == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefStorageUnknownTag ||
       bodyIR.exactDef.opProducerFunctionRows[site.definition] !=
           bodyIR.controlFunctionRow:
        return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
            bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)
    # expected_ownership (C 25880-25899): def 自身借用族 → 自身 own;
    # 否则 source 借用族且非 independent cell → 继承 source own; 否
    # 则 storage==PLAIN→PLAIN, 否→MOVE。
    var expectedOwnership = ownership
    if !exactDefCallAuthorityOwnershipIsBorrow(ownership):
        var inherited = false
        if site.source >= 0 && site.source < bodyIR.ops.len:
            let sourceOwnership =
                Int32(bodyIR.ops[site.source].valueDefOwnership)
            if exactDefCallAuthorityOwnershipIsBorrow(sourceOwnership) &&
               !freeze.ExactDefFreezePlainValueCopyIndependent(
                   bodyIR, bodyIR.ops[site.source].valueDefSlot):
                expectedOwnership = sourceOwnership
                inherited = true
        if !inherited:
            if storage == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefStoragePlainTag:
                expectedOwnership = Int32(coreir.OwnPlain)
            else:
                expectedOwnership = Int32(coreir.OwnMove)
    if ownership != expectedOwnership:
        return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
            bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)
    # source 边 (C 26180-26197 重证): 自根 (-1) 或物理边在界+reaches+
    # 同槽。
    if site.source >= 0:
        if site.source >= bodyIR.ops.len ||
           !freeze.ExactDefFreezeIdentityReaches(
               bodyIR, dom, workspace.opBlockIds, site.source,
               site.definition) ||
           bodyIR.ops[site.source].valueDefSlot != site.valueSlot:
            return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
                bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)
    # 形态特化段。
    if site.form == ExactDefCallAuthorityFormProjectionWriteback:
        # 投影槽身份绑定 formal (C 26157-26168): own==BORROW_UNIQUE;
        # 投影槽权威 (C 26174-26179): 槽元数据终态须 BORROW_PROJECTION
        # place; 同根诱饵槽非权威 (值实参时 CSR 钉 carrier 不钉他槽)。
        if ownership != Int32(coreir.OwnBorrowUnique) ||
           bodyIR.exactDef.slotPlaceKinds[site.valueSlot] !=
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceBorrowProjectionTag:
            return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
                bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)
        if sentinel == 0 && sourceMatch == 0:
            return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
                bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)
        # 根 cell 活性 (C 29365-29386): 调用前当前定义 live before call。
        if !freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityIsLiveBeforeOp(
               bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, site.carrier, site.callOp):
            return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
                bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)
        return true
    if site.form == ExactDefCallAuthorityFormSretForward:
        # consume 四析取 + source 为投影时 place 必须 BORROW_PROJECTION
        # (C 26142-26144)。
        if !exactDefCallAuthorityForwardedConsumeValid(
               bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, site):
            return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
                bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)
        if site.source >= 0 && site.source != site.carrier &&
           bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[site.source] !=
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceBorrowProjectionTag:
            return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
                bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)
        return true
    if site.form == ExactDefCallAuthorityFormOutDirect:
        # 值实参 CSR 四列==carrier 四列 (分类段已证) + 块门豁免锚定
        # (C 26394-26403: 载体块可与调用块不同, 活性由初始化源证 —
        #  分类段 carrier 回收已含 reaches 证明)。
        if sourceMatch == 0:
            return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
                bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)
        return true
    if site.form == ExactDefCallAuthorityFormCopyLocalWriteback:
        # 载体 origin 归约到该 cell 当前定义 (分类段 carrier 回收即
        # 该 cell 调用前当前定义+reaches 证明) + CSR 三车道承认。
        if sentinel == 0 && sourceMatch == 0:
            return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
                bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)
        return true
    return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
        bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)

# 投影 publication 发布组全证 (规格 §1.5/§6-5; root publication
# helper 的 Cheng 重证, 判词按任务书口径并入九字段 authority
# mismatch): 投影行递归完整校验 (op 严格递减保证终止, memo 不移植)
# + 根 cell 基座解析 (投影行直接基座或经投影定义行) + 根行 BU +
# 版本链互指 (source[根]==投影行) + 同槽 tie consume∈{0,根+1}。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutPublicationValid(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        workspace: var freeze.ExactDefFreezeWorkspace,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        phase: str,
        site: ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite): bool =
    let rootOp = bodyIR.ops[site.definition]
    let projectionOp = bodyIR.ops[site.publicationCarrier]
    let exactType = bodyIR.exactDef.opExactTypeIds[site.definition]
    let storage = bodyIR.exactDef.slotStorageKinds[site.valueSlot]
    # 投影行递归完整校验 (同调用同形参, 物理序递减)。
    if !exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutDefinitionValid(
           bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, phase,
           site.publicationCarrier):
        return false
    # 根 cell 基座解析: 投影行写经基座 (FieldStore/IndexedStore 的
    # operands[0]) 或投影定义行的基槽 (CopyLocal/StoreLocal 写的投影
    # cell, 其调用前当前定义是投影三种且基槽==根 cell)。
    var baseMatches = false
    if projectionOp.kind == coreir.BodyOpFieldStoreTag ||
       projectionOp.kind == coreir.BodyOpIndexedStoreTag:
        baseMatches = exactDefCallAuthorityOpOperandOrInvalid(
            projectionOp, 0) == site.valueSlot
    else:
        let projectionSlot = projectionOp.valueDefSlot
        let projectionDef = exactDefCallAuthorityCurrentDefBefore(
            bodyIR, dom, workspace.opBlockIds, projectionSlot,
            site.callOp)
        if projectionDef >= 0:
            let projectionDefOp = bodyIR.ops[projectionDef]
            let projectionKind =
                projectionDefOp.kind == coreir.BodyOpFieldLoadTag ||
                projectionDefOp.kind == coreir.BodyOpIndexedLoadTag ||
                projectionDefOp.kind == coreir.BodyOpResultProjectTag
            baseMatches = projectionKind &&
                exactDefCallAuthorityOpOperandOrInvalid(
                    projectionDefOp, 0) == site.valueSlot
    # 版本链互指 + 根行 BU + 同槽 tie (C 29636-29641: consume 只写同
    # 槽 tie, 跨槽谱系走 origin/source 列)。
    let consumePlusOne = projectionOp.valueDefConsumeOpIndexPlusOne
    if !baseMatches ||
       Int32(rootOp.valueDefOwnership) != Int32(coreir.OwnBorrowUnique) ||
       site.source != site.publicationCarrier ||
       (consumePlusOne != 0 &&
        consumePlusOne != site.definition + 1):
        return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchEmit(
            bodyIR, site, exactType, storage, 0, 0)
    return true

# 分类器本体 (C cold_exact_call_var_out_definition_valid_impl 的
# Cheng 重证)。入口门 (C 25507-25512): 非 MV place → false 无判词;
# sentinel 静默拒 (C 25521-25533) 的 Cheng 对应 = 批 3 主审空组哨兵
# 链 (C 67941-67946 臂), 本入口 place==MV 前置使其结构上不可达 (锚
# 定注释)。MEMORY_VERSION 域门 (C 25539-25543) 即入口 place 前置。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutDefinitionValid(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        workspace: var freeze.ExactDefFreezeWorkspace,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        phase: str,
        definition: int32): bool =
    if definition < 0 || definition >= bodyIR.ops.len:
        return false
    if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[definition] !=
           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceMemoryVersionTag:
        return false
    var site: ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite
    if !exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutRecover(
           bodyIR, workspace.opBlockIds, definition, site):
        site.definition = definition
        if definition >= 0 && definition < bodyIR.ops.len:
            site.valueSlot = bodyIR.ops[definition].valueDefSlot
            site.source = exactDefCallAuthorityOpSourceDefRow(
                bodyIR.ops[definition])
        return exactDefCallAuthorityIndexStructureEmit(bodyIR, site)
    if !exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutClassify(
           bodyIR, dom, workspace.opBlockIds, site):
        return exactDefCallAuthorityIndexStructureEmit(bodyIR, site)
    if site.form == ExactDefCallAuthorityFormProjectionPublication:
        return exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutPublicationValid(
            bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, phase, site)
    if site.form == ExactDefCallAuthorityFormNone:
        # 载体缺席: 未初始化源形承认, 否则结构判词。
        if site.carrier < 0:
            if exactDefCallAuthorityUninitializedSourceValid(bodyIR, site):
                return true
            return exactDefCallAuthorityIndexStructureEmit(bodyIR, site)
        return exactDefCallAuthorityIndexStructureEmit(bodyIR, site)
    return exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutAuthorityValid(
        bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, site)

# ---- 调用权威三族 (规格 §2 发布器的 Cheng 只校验面) ----

# 全局臂 (C 28389-28434 重证): global_def 是 GlobalLoad+GLOBAL place+
# BORROW_SHARED+origin>=0+consume==0+is_live_before_op(call)。全局实
# 参永不发 post-call 版本行 (C 29584-29588 — callee 写入已经
# GLOBAL_ADDR 落到全局存储; Cheng 无 MV 车道, 注释锚定)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityGlobalVarCallValid(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        workspace: var freeze.ExactDefFreezeWorkspace,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        globalDef: int32,
        callOp: int32): bool =
    if globalDef < 0 || globalDef >= bodyIR.ops.len:
        return false
    let op = bodyIR.ops[globalDef]
    if op.kind != coreir.BodyOpGlobalLoadTag ||
       bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[globalDef] !=
           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceGlobalTag ||
       op.valueDefOwnership != coreir.OwnBorrowShared ||
       bodyIR.exactDef.opOriginIds[globalDef] < 0 ||
       op.valueDefConsumeOpIndexPlusOne != 0:
        return false
    return freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityIsLiveBeforeOp(
        bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, globalDef, callOp)

# shared-borrow 臂 (C 23111-23230 重证): 借用根冻结权威+调用前活性。
# 本臂是负例族判词分流器, 不是放行路径 (规格 §2.5): 一过随即无条件
# 第二判词 die。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthoritySharedBorrowVarCallValid(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        workspace: var freeze.ExactDefFreezeWorkspace,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        sourceDef: int32,
        callOp: int32): bool =
    if sourceDef < 0 || sourceDef >= bodyIR.ops.len:
        return false
    if !freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityBorrowResultRootValid(
           bodyIR, sourceDef):
        return false
    return freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityIsLiveBeforeOp(
        bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, sourceDef, callOp)

# 投影实参臂 (C 28915-29031 重证): unique 投影根 (owner 链终态闭包,
# wantUnique=true) + 调用前活性 + source 未触 (consume==0 或记录消费
# 者在调用之后)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityProjectionVarCallValid(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        workspace: var freeze.ExactDefFreezeWorkspace,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        sourceDef: int32,
        callOp: int32): bool =
    if sourceDef < 0 || sourceDef >= bodyIR.ops.len:
        return false
    let op = bodyIR.ops[sourceDef]
    if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[sourceDef] !=
           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceBorrowProjectionTag ||
       op.valueDefOwnership != coreir.OwnBorrowUnique:
        return false
    let consumePlusOne = op.valueDefConsumeOpIndexPlusOne
    if consumePlusOne != 0 && consumePlusOne - 1 <= callOp:
        return false
    if !exactDefCallAuthorityBorrowTerminalRootValid(
           bodyIR, sourceDef, true):
        return false
    return freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityIsLiveBeforeOp(
        bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, sourceDef, callOp)

# W8 unique-borrow 臂 (C 29032-29090/22325-22470 重证): reaches+
# current-at-predecessor+live-before-call+权威四析取 (帧自有/PARAM+
# 定义边/CFG_MERGE 批 4 主审域/借用 owner 终态闭包)。未初始化源形
# (无当前定义) 由调用方先行承认, 不进本臂。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityUniqueBorrowVarCallValid(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        workspace: var freeze.ExactDefFreezeWorkspace,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        sourceDef: int32,
        callOp: int32,
        callBlock: int32): bool =
    if sourceDef < 0 || sourceDef >= bodyIR.ops.len || callBlock < 0:
        return false
    if !freeze.ExactDefFreezeIdentityReaches(
           bodyIR, dom, workspace.opBlockIds, sourceDef, callOp):
        return false
    if !freeze.ExactDefFreezeIdentityIsCurrentAtPredecessor(
           bodyIR, dom, workspace.opBlockIds, sourceDef, callBlock,
           callOp):
        return false
    if !freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityIsLiveBeforeOp(
           bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, sourceDef, callOp):
        return false
    if identity.ExactDefIdentityDefinitionRootsFrameOwnedSlot(
           bodyIR, sourceDef):
        return true
    if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[sourceDef] ==
           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceParamTag:
        return freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityParamDefinitionEdgeValid(
            bodyIR, sourceDef)
    if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[sourceDef] ==
           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceCfgMergeTag:
        return true
    let ownership = Int32(bodyIR.ops[sourceDef].valueDefOwnership)
    if exactDefCallAuthorityOwnershipIsBorrow(ownership):
        return exactDefCallAuthorityBorrowTerminalRootValid(
            bodyIR, sourceDef, true)
    return false

# @borrow_result var root 臂 (C 24468-24724 重证; 单位级校验器 — 生
# 产触发真空锚定, 见模块头职责 3)。契约合取 (C 28721-28736):
# FORMAL+singleton (mask==0 或 mask==1<<formal) +global==-1+
# READ_ONLY_PROVEN; 不成立 → true (非本臂调用, 不放行不判词)。
# 成立后三载体形 (local-address / forwarded var param / exact
# projection) + 身份链 + reaches 双链 + source[call]==carrier, 不过
# → die 判词逐字。callee 五槽由调用方 (契约表/夹具) 显式带入。
@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityBorrowResultVarRootCallValid(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        workspace: var freeze.ExactDefFreezeWorkspace,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        callOp: int32,
        param: int32,
        contractRootKind: int32,
        contractFormalIndex: int32,
        contractFormalMask: int32,
        contractGlobalRow: int32,
        contractReadOnlyProof: int32): bool =
    # 契约合取 (singleton-only, C 28728-28729 注释同)。
    if contractRootKind != exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootFormalTag ||
       contractFormalIndex != param ||
       (contractFormalMask != 0 &&
        !(param >= 0 && param < 32 &&
          contractFormalMask == 1 << param)) ||
       contractGlobalRow != -1 ||
       contractReadOnlyProof !=
           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractReadOnlyProvenTag:
        return true
    var valid = false
    if callOp >= 0 && callOp < bodyIR.ops.len:
        let callBodyOp = bodyIR.ops[callOp]
        if callBodyOp.kind == coreir.BodyOpCallTag &&
           callBodyOp.operands.len == 1:
            let callRow = callBodyOp.operands[0]
            if callRow >= 0 && callRow < bodyIR.callSequence.len &&
               param >= 0 &&
               param < bodyIR.callSequence[callRow].argSlots.len:
                let call = bodyIR.callSequence[callRow]
                let encoded = call.argSlots[param]
                var valueSlot = encoded
                if coreir.CallArgSlotIsAddress(encoded):
                    valueSlot = coreir.CallArgSlotAddressId(encoded)
                if valueSlot >= 0 &&
                   valueSlot < bodyIR.localSlots.len:
                    let carrier = exactDefCallAuthorityCurrentDefBefore(
                        bodyIR, dom, workspace.opBlockIds, valueSlot,
                        callOp)
                    if carrier >= 0:
                        # 三载体形 (C 24527-24582): local-address
                        # (帧自有) / forwarded var param (PARAM+BU+
                        # 定义边) / exact projection (投影载体+终
                        # 端根==source 自身车道, owner 终态闭包)。
                        var carrierShape =
                            identity.ExactDefIdentityDefinitionRootsFrameOwnedSlot(
                                bodyIR, carrier)
                        if !carrierShape &&
                           bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[carrier] ==
                               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceParamTag &&
                           bodyIR.ops[carrier].valueDefOwnership ==
                               coreir.OwnBorrowUnique:
                            carrierShape =
                                freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityParamDefinitionEdgeValid(
                                    bodyIR, carrier)
                        if !carrierShape &&
                           bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[carrier] ==
                               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceBorrowProjectionTag:
                            carrierShape =
                                exactDefCallAuthorityBorrowTerminalRootValid(
                                    bodyIR, carrier, false)
                        # 身份链+双链+source[call]==carrier (C 24611-
                        # 24723 重证; formal var 车道证据+同块)。
                        let callBlock = workspace.opBlockIds[callOp]
                        var passKind: int32 = -1
                        if param < call.argPassKinds.len:
                            passKind = call.argPassKinds[param]
                        valid = carrierShape &&
                            (passKind ==
                                 coreir.BodyCallPassParamAddressTag ||
                             passKind ==
                                 coreir.BodyCallPassForwardEntrySretTag) &&
                            bodyIR.exactDef.slotStorageKinds[valueSlot] !=
                                exactdef.BodyIrExactDefStorageUnknownTag &&
                            freeze.ExactDefFreezeIdentityReaches(
                                bodyIR, dom, workspace.opBlockIds,
                                carrier, callOp) &&
                            exactDefCallAuthorityOpSourceDefRow(
                                callBodyOp) == carrier &&
                            callBlock >= 0 &&
                            callBlock == workspace.opBlockIds[carrier]
    if !valid:
        exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
            "@borrow_result var root call authority is not exact")
    return true

# 逐 CallOp 逐 var 形参实参分派 (发布器主循环的 Cheng 只校验面;
# 门序: 绑定 → 重叠 → 可变性(真空锚定) → storage UNKNOWN 跳 → 全局
# 臂 → shared 臂 → 投影臂 → W8 unique 臂)。
@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityCallValid(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        workspace: var freeze.ExactDefFreezeWorkspace,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        callOp: int32,
        contract: exactdef.ExactProgramContract,
        contractActive: bool,
        calleeRows: int32[]) =
    let op = bodyIR.ops[callOp]
    let callRow = op.operands[0]
    if callRow < 0 || callRow >= bodyIR.callSequence.len:
        exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
            "call var-out resolved function binding is invalid")
    let call = bodyIR.callSequence[callRow]
    let callBlock = workspace.opBlockIds[callOp]
    # wall37 callee-formals 门: 本车道自锚 C formal_is_var, 以 callee
    # 存在 Cheng 形参表为前提。calleeRows 窗按键车道逐 callSequence 行
    # 送达 (键车道: semanticCallExprNodeIndex→callDeclaration 投影;
    # typed_expr 生产坐标守卫硬性要求 importc 声明
    # producerFunctionRow==-1, 合成调用无 call declaration), 窗内 -1 =
    # importc/合成 callee = 无 Cheng 形参表 — 其 ParamAddress/
    # ForwardEntrySret 地址实参是 C-ABI 消费/桥接拼写 (runtime intrinsic
    # 如 cheng_seq_str_add 收编 piece、managed-replace 栈槽源), 不是 var
    # formal 绑定, 全 call 不进本车道。真 Cheng callee (>=0) 与空窗
    # (canonical-empty 契约态, 批 5 REPORT §5 非降级口径) 行为不变。
    if calleeRows.len != 0 && calleeRows[callRow] < 0:
        return
    var seenSlots: int32[]
    for argIndex in 0..<call.argSlots.len:
        var passKind: int32 = -1
        if argIndex < call.argPassKinds.len:
            passKind = call.argPassKinds[argIndex]
        # var 形参可变地址车道 (C formal_is_var 的 Cheng 证据;
        # byval/@borrows 车道不进本族)。
        let isVarFormal = passKind == coreir.BodyCallPassParamAddressTag ||
            passKind == coreir.BodyCallPassForwardEntrySretTag
        if !isVarFormal:
            continue
        let encoded = call.argSlots[argIndex]
        var valueSlot = encoded
        if coreir.CallArgSlotIsAddress(encoded):
            valueSlot = coreir.CallArgSlotAddressId(encoded)
        if valueSlot < 0 || valueSlot >= bodyIR.localSlots.len:
            exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
                "call var-out resolved function binding is invalid")
        # wall37 canonical-consume 源实参分离: call 自带 access decode
        # 已验的 canonical 消费权威 (sourceDefinition 对 + consumeActionRow,
        # w35 ManagedLvalueReplaceProductionBindIntrinsicSourceConsume
        # 接线, 与 append-only managed move 事件同一 ingress 域) 且实参
        # 槽 = 被消费源定义所在槽时, 该实参是消费源而非 var formal 绑定
        # — 精确性由 canonical-consume 证据族背书 (body_ir_access
        # explicitSourceConsumer + 生产道逐列 OwnMove mirror 戳), 被
        # intrinsic 消费的 fresh temp 结构上不可能同时是合法 rebindable
        # var-formal 源。无消费权威的实参 (含 smoke N7 族) 照旧全量审。
        if call.consumeActionRow >= 0 &&
           call.sourceDefinitionDomain ==
               coreir.BodyDefinitionDomainBodyOpTag &&
           call.sourceDefinitionRow >= 0 &&
           call.sourceDefinitionRow < bodyIR.ops.len &&
           bodyIR.ops[call.sourceDefinitionRow].valueDefSlot == valueSlot:
            continue
        for seen in 0..<seenSlots.len:
            if seenSlots[seen] == valueSlot:
                exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
                    "overlapping places cannot bind multiple var formals in one call")
        add(seenSlots, valueSlot)
        # 可变性门 (C 28666-28716) 真空锚定 — BodyIR 无 is_mutable
        # 列, let-bound var 实参 TypedExpr 先拒 (判词保真锚点, 任何
        # 未来可变位列落地即被本门接住)。
        if bodyIR.exactDef.slotStorageKinds[valueSlot] ==
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefStorageUnknownTag:
            # 标量无 nominal 身份 (C 28720)。
            continue
        # @borrow_result var root 臂生产触发 (C 28721-28863; 契约表按
        # callee TypedExpr 函数行经键车道窗送达, 规格 §4.5)。合取成
        # 立 → 臂校验 (不过即 die) 并 continue (不发 post-call 版本
        # 行, C 28858-28863 注释同); 不成立 → 落后续臂。
        if contractActive && callRow < calleeRows.len:
            let calleeRow = calleeRows[callRow]
            if calleeRow >= 0 && calleeRow < contract.rootKinds.len:
                let contractHolds =
                    contract.rootKinds[calleeRow] ==
                        exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootFormalTag &&
                    contract.formalIndexs[calleeRow] == argIndex &&
                    (contract.formalMasks[calleeRow] == 0 ||
                     (argIndex < 32 &&
                      contract.formalMasks[calleeRow] == 1 << argIndex)) &&
                    contract.globalRows[calleeRow] == -1 &&
                    contract.readOnlyProofs[calleeRow] ==
                        exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractReadOnlyProvenTag
                if contractHolds:
                    let _ = ExactDefCallAuthorityBorrowResultVarRootCallValid(
                        bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, callOp, argIndex,
                        contract.rootKinds[calleeRow],
                        contract.formalIndexs[calleeRow],
                        contract.formalMasks[calleeRow],
                        contract.globalRows[calleeRow],
                        contract.readOnlyProofs[calleeRow])
                    continue
        let actual = exactDefCallAuthorityCurrentDefBefore(
            bodyIR, dom, workspace.opBlockIds, valueSlot, callOp)
        if actual < 0:
            # 未初始化源形承认 (C 26439-26447 同族锚定: 无当前定
            # 义且 [0,call) 无该 cell 定义)。
            var sawDefinition = false
            for opRow in 0..<callOp:
                if bodyIR.ops[opRow].valueDefSlot == valueSlot:
                    sawDefinition = true
                    break
            if !sawDefinition:
                continue
            exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
                "call var unique-borrow authority is not exact")
        let actualOwnership = Int32(bodyIR.ops[actual].valueDefOwnership)
        if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[actual] ==
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceGlobalTag:
            if !exactDefCallAuthorityGlobalVarCallValid(
                   bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, actual, callOp):
                exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
                    "call var global source is not live unique authority")
            continue
        if actualOwnership == Int32(coreir.OwnBorrowShared):
            if !exactDefCallAuthoritySharedBorrowVarCallValid(
                   bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, actual, callOp):
                exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
                    "call var shared-borrow authority is not exact")
            exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
                "borrowed managed local cannot bind a rebindable var formal")
        if actualOwnership == Int32(coreir.OwnBorrowUnique) &&
           bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[actual] ==
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceBorrowProjectionTag:
            if !exactDefCallAuthorityProjectionVarCallValid(
                   bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, actual, callOp):
                exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
                    "call var projection root is not a live mutable place")
            continue
        if !exactDefCallAuthorityUniqueBorrowVarCallValid(
               bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, actual, callOp, callBlock):
            exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
                "call var unique-borrow authority is not exact")

# ---- 墙3 store 爬升 (规格 §2.9; 帧自有谓词第四处接线) ----

@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityIndexedStoreValid(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        dom: freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominators,
        workspace: var freeze.ExactDefFreezeWorkspace,
        storeOp: int32) =
    let op = bodyIR.ops[storeOp]
    let baseSlot = exactDefCallAuthorityOpOperandOrInvalid(op, 0)
    if baseSlot < 0 || baseSlot >= bodyIR.localSlots.len:
        return
    if !exactDefCallAuthoritySlotManagedStorage(bodyIR, baseSlot):
        # 非托管基座不是墙3族 (标量元素 store 无 unique 基座义务)。
        return
    # 基座当前定义 (发射序末定义+reaches)。
    let baseDef = exactDefCallAuthorityCurrentDefBefore(
        bodyIR, dom, workspace.opBlockIds, baseSlot, storeOp)
    if baseDef < 0:
        # 新鲜 owned 帧 cell 的普通 store (构造器物化形态: 零初始化+
        # 逐字段 FieldStore 的目标聚合, 其权威由本次 store 自身建
        # 立) — C 墙3 门 (cold_parse_store_field_path_into_ref_exact)
        # 只核 **ref 路径** store 的 unique 基座权威, 非 ref 槽不属
        # 该族 (批 5 夹具 P2/P7 门形态之外的生产实物形, 批 6 构造器
        # 物化臂落地时实证)。ref 槽 (typeFact structural==RefObject)
        # 无定义 → 无权威可证 → 判词。
        let baseTypeId = bodyIR.localSlots[baseSlot].typeArenaTypeId
        if baseTypeId >= 0 &&
           freeze.ExactDefFreezeTypeFactStructuralKind(
               bodyIR, baseTypeId) ==
               Int32(typearena.TypedExprStructuralTypeRefObject):
            exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
                "indexed element field store lacks exact unique base authority")
        return
    let ownership = Int32(bodyIR.ops[baseDef].valueDefOwnership)
    if ownership == Int32(coreir.OwnMove) ||
       ownership == Int32(coreir.OwnPlain):
        # owned 基座槽约定臂 (C 82847-82860 同族; 批 3 根门已审)。
        return
    if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[baseDef] ==
           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceCfgMergeTag:
        # CFG_MERGE 基座 = 批 4 merge 权威主审域。
        return
    if exactDefCallAuthorityOwnershipIsBorrow(ownership):
        let place = bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[baseDef]
        if place == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceParamTag &&
           ownership == Int32(coreir.OwnBorrowUnique):
            if freeze.ExactDefFreezeAuthorityParamDefinitionEdgeValid(
                   bodyIR, baseDef):
                return
            exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
                "indexed element field store lacks exact unique base authority")
        # 借用基座: SHARED 链走帧自有根 (墙3 第一跳, C 82839-82841;
        # 批 3 帧自有谓词单实现同源), UNIQUE 链走 owner 终态闭包。
        if exactDefCallAuthorityBorrowTerminalRootValid(
               bodyIR, baseDef, ownership == Int32(coreir.OwnBorrowUnique)):
            return
    exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
        "indexed element field store lacks exact unique base authority")

# ---- seal/canonical root 只校验不重走 (规格 §3.3 四不变量) ----

# 每托管借用定义行的冻结 borrow-owner 三元组逐行核; 违上游不变式 =
# panic hard fail (单行确定, Let it crash, 非夹具判词)。
fn exactDefCallAuthoritySealRootInvariantScan(bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR) =
    let opCount = bodyIR.ops.len
    let slotCount = bodyIR.localSlots.len
    for definition in 0..<opCount:
        let op = bodyIR.ops[definition]
        let ownership = Int32(op.valueDefOwnership)
        if !exactDefCallAuthorityOwnershipIsBorrow(ownership):
            continue
        let slot = op.valueDefSlot
        if slot < 0 || slot >= slotCount:
            continue
        if bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[definition] ==
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceMemoryVersionTag:
            # MV 版本行 = var-out 分类器域 (四版本验证器车道), 非
            # seal root 域 — C 同 (seal root 只服务借用链)。
            continue
        if !exactDefCallAuthoritySlotManagedStorage(bodyIR, slot):
            # 标量借用无单一托管权威 (非 seal root 域; C §3.1-6 白名
            # 单反面的静态道)。
            continue
        let domain = op.valueDefBorrowOwnerDefinitionDomain
        if domain == coreir.BodyDefinitionDomainBodyOpTag:
            let owner = op.valueDefBorrowOwnerDefinitionRow
            if owner < 0 || owner >= opCount:
                panic(Fmt"exact def call authority: borrow owner op row invalid op={definition}")
            if owner >= definition:
                # 单调无环 (TypedExpr 冻结列保证 owner<dependent)。
                panic(Fmt"exact def call authority: borrow owner order violated op={definition}")
            let ownerSlot = bodyIR.ops[owner].valueDefSlot
            if ownerSlot < 0 || ownerSlot >= slotCount:
                panic(Fmt"exact def call authority: borrow owner slot invalid op={definition}")
            let ownerType = bodyIR.exactDef.opExactTypeIds[owner]
            if ownerType >= 0 &&
               bodyIR.localSlots[ownerSlot].typeArenaTypeId >= 0 &&
               ownerType != bodyIR.localSlots[ownerSlot].typeArenaTypeId:
                # ownerTypeId==定义行 TypeId 自洽 (规格 §3.3-1)。
                panic(Fmt"exact def call authority: borrow owner type drift op={definition}")
        elif domain == coreir.BodyDefinitionDomainEntrySlotTag:
            let ownerSlot = op.valueDefBorrowOwnerDefinitionRow
            if ownerSlot < 0 || ownerSlot >= slotCount:
                panic(Fmt"exact def call authority: borrow owner entry slot invalid op={definition}")
            # 终态白名单 (C §3.1-6): 形参物化槽 storage∈{OBJECT,STR};
            # 全局地址槽 (GLOBAL 终态); 标量/序列槽不成根。
            var isParam = false
            for ordinal in 0..<bodyIR.entryParameterSlotIds.len:
                if bodyIR.entryParameterSlotIds[ordinal] == ownerSlot:
                    isParam = true
                    break
            if isParam:
                let ownerStorage =
                    bodyIR.exactDef.slotStorageKinds[ownerSlot]
                if ownerStorage != exactdef.BodyIrExactDefStorageObjectTag &&
                   ownerStorage != exactdef.BodyIrExactDefStorageStrTag:
                    panic(Fmt"exact def call authority: borrow owner terminal is not a managed root kind op={definition}")
            elif bodyIR.localSlots[ownerSlot].placeKind !=
                     coreir.BodyPlaceGlobalAddressTag:
                panic(Fmt"exact def call authority: borrow owner terminal domain invalid op={definition}")
        elif domain == coreir.BodyDefinitionDomainInvalidTag:
            # 无 owner 三元 → 本行须自证终态 (C §3.1-9 三终态):
            # PARAM / GLOBAL / owned 本地构造。
            let place = bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[definition]
            if place == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceParamTag ||
               place == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceGlobalTag:
                continue
            if place == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceCfgMergeTag:
                # CFG_MERGE 借用根 = 批 4 merge 权威主审域 (borrow
                # 根冻结三列逐值相等), 本层不重检。
                continue
            if place == exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceSharedCopyTag:
                # SHARED_COPY 根权威 = origin 车道 (批 3 SHARED_COPY
                # 臂同源: origin 行即借用源定义)。
                let origin = bodyIR.exactDef.opOriginIds[definition]
                if origin >= 0 && origin < opCount:
                    continue
                panic(Fmt"exact def call authority: borrow owner terminal is not canonical op={definition}")
            # 借用构造无终态 → hard fail (C 56039 return -1 同族)。
            panic(Fmt"exact def call authority: borrow owner terminal is not canonical op={definition}")
        else:
            panic(Fmt"exact def call authority: borrow owner domain invalid op={definition}")

# ---- 程序契约表行为函数 (canonical empty/shape/seal/CID; 规格 §4.1
#      五槽 §4.5 扩列。类型/值域常量在 body_ir_exact_def 持单定义; 行
#      为函数在本模块持单实现 — body_ir_exact_def.cheng 是钉死种子死
#      点行 fn=11464 之前的有序模块, 新增函数会移动死点行号 (零漂移
#      口径不许, 批 5 实证), 本模块在死点后) ----

@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityContractIsCanonicalEmpty(
        contract: exactdef.ExactProgramContract): bool =
    return !contract.sealed &&
           contract.rootKinds.len == 0 &&
           contract.formalIndexs.len == 0 &&
           contract.formalMasks.len == 0 &&
           contract.globalRows.len == 0 &&
           contract.readOnlyProofs.len == 0 &&
           layout.FixedBytes32Equal(
               contract.contractCid, layout.FixedBytes32())

@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityContractShapeValid(
        contract: exactdef.ExactProgramContract): bool =
    if !contract.sealed:
        # 未冻结只承认 canonical empty (推导前合法态)。
        return ExactDefCallAuthorityContractIsCanonicalEmpty(contract)
    let functionCount = contract.rootKinds.len
    if contract.formalIndexs.len != functionCount ||
       contract.formalMasks.len != functionCount ||
       contract.globalRows.len != functionCount ||
       contract.readOnlyProofs.len != functionCount:
        return false
    for row in 0..<functionCount:
        let rootKind = contract.rootKinds[row]
        if rootKind < exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootUnknownTag ||
           rootKind > exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootStaticTag:
            return false
        if contract.readOnlyProofs[row] !=
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractReadOnlyUnknownTag &&
           contract.readOnlyProofs[row] !=
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractReadOnlyProvenTag:
            return false
    return !layout.FixedBytes32Equal(
        contract.contractCid, layout.FixedBytes32())

fn ExactDefCallAuthorityContractReset(
        contract: var exactdef.ExactProgramContract) =
    contract.rootKinds = []
    contract.formalIndexs = []
    contract.formalMasks = []
    contract.globalRows = []
    contract.readOnlyProofs = []
    contract.sealed = false
    contract.contractCid = layout.FixedBytes32()

fn exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendI32(buf: var layout.ByteBuf,
                                     value: int32) =
    layout.ByteBufAppendByte(buf, value & 255)
    layout.ByteBufAppendByte(buf, (value >> 8) & 255)
    layout.ByteBufAppendByte(buf, (value >> 16) & 255)
    layout.ByteBufAppendByte(buf, (value >> 24) & 255)

fn exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendColumn(buf: var layout.ByteBuf,
                                        column: var int32[]) =
    exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendI32(buf, column.len)
    for row in 0..<column.len:
        exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendI32(buf, column[row])

fn exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendText(buf: var layout.ByteBuf,
                                      text: str) =
    exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendI32(buf, len(text))
    for index in 0..<len(text):
        layout.ByteBufAppendByte(buf, Int32(text[index]) & 255)

# seal: 五列 dense 等长 (形状前置证明) → CID 指纹一次落 + sealed。
# CID 域标签 + 按声明序全列 LE; 不含任何表外状态, 同列同 CID。
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityContractSealInto(
        contract: var exactdef.ExactProgramContract) =
    if contract.sealed:
        panic("exact def call authority: contract already sealed")
    let functionCount = contract.rootKinds.len
    if contract.formalIndexs.len != functionCount ||
       contract.formalMasks.len != functionCount ||
       contract.globalRows.len != functionCount ||
       contract.readOnlyProofs.len != functionCount:
        panic("exact def call authority: contract seal shape incomplete")
    for row in 0..<functionCount:
        let rootKind = contract.rootKinds[row]
        if rootKind < exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootUnknownTag ||
           rootKind > exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootStaticTag ||
           (contract.readOnlyProofs[row] !=
                exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractReadOnlyUnknownTag &&
            contract.readOnlyProofs[row] !=
                exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractReadOnlyProvenTag):
            panic("exact def call authority: contract seal value domain invalid")
    var buf = layout.ByteBufInit(1024)
    exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendText(
        buf, exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractCidDomainTag)
    exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendColumn(buf, contract.rootKinds)
    exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendColumn(buf, contract.formalIndexs)
    exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendColumn(buf, contract.formalMasks)
    exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendColumn(buf, contract.globalRows)
    exactDefCallAuthorityCidAppendColumn(buf, contract.readOnlyProofs)
    contract.contractCid =
        hash256.Sha256Fixed(layout.ByteBufView(buf))
    layout.ByteBufFree(buf)
    contract.sealed = true

# ---- 程序契约表推导 (规格 §4.5; TypedExpr 冻结列直读, 顺序无关) ----

@borrows
fn exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(phase: str,
                                       functionRow: int32,
                                       reason: str) =
    exactDefCallAuthorityDie(
        exactDefCallAuthorityContractRejectLine(phase, functionRow,
                                                reason))

# 逐函数五槽推导 + 快照窗恒等校验 (§4.2-7); reject = die 语义 (C
# cold_function_contract_reject 同: stderr 单行 + 进程退出)。输入窗全
# 为 TypedExpr 冻结列的 int32 投影 (本模块不 import typed_expr, 与批 1
# derive 窗纪律同款):
#   resultExprClasses    — functions2_resultExprClasses 序数投影
#   formalCounts         — 每函数形参数 (formal 范围门)
#   returnExactTypeIds   — 每函数 return_exact_type_id (-1 未证)
#   globalTypeIds        — 全局行 TypeId 重算窗 (GLOBAL 臂恒等门)
#   retStarts/retCounts  — 每函数 RET 节点 CSR
#   retRootDomains/Rows/TypeIds — RET 物化 owner 域/行/TypeId 窗
#   retFormalTypeIds     — RET owner 形参的冻结 TypeId (formal 恒等门)
#   formalRootsReadOnly  — FORMAL mask 成员 read-only 证据窗 (§2.3 四
#                          拒绝集的 TypedExpr 侧重述结果, manualConsume*
#                          投影; compiler_csg 接线时填窗)
#   expect*              — 快照窗 (解析期序列化五槽; §4.2-7 恒等校验)
@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityProgramContractDerive(
        contract: var exactdef.ExactProgramContract,
        phase: str,
        functionCount: int32,
        resultExprClasses: int32[],
        formalCounts: int32[],
        returnExactTypeIds: int32[],
        globalTypeIds: int32[],
        retStarts: int32[],
        retCounts: int32[],
        retRootDomains: int32[],
        retRootRows: int32[],
        retRootTypeIds: int32[],
        retFormalTypeIds: int32[],
        formalRootsReadOnly: bool[],
        expectRootKinds: int32[],
        expectFormalIndexs: int32[],
        expectFormalMasks: int32[],
        expectGlobalRows: int32[],
        expectReadOnlyProofs: int32[]) =
    if functionCount < 0 || resultExprClasses.len != functionCount ||
       formalCounts.len != functionCount ||
       returnExactTypeIds.len != functionCount ||
       retStarts.len != functionCount ||
       retCounts.len != functionCount ||
       formalRootsReadOnly.len != functionCount:
        panic("exact def call authority: contract derive window invalid")
    if expectRootKinds.len != functionCount ||
       expectFormalIndexs.len != functionCount ||
       expectFormalMasks.len != functionCount ||
       expectGlobalRows.len != functionCount ||
       expectReadOnlyProofs.len != functionCount:
        exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
            phase, -1, "borrow-result comparison snapshot is missing")
    # CSR 形状门 (§4.2-3 完整 CFG 证据的窗对应物)。
    var retTotal: int32
    for row in 0..<functionCount:
        let start = retStarts[row]
        let count = retCounts[row]
        if start != retTotal || count < 0:
            exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                phase, row, "borrowed result lacks a complete CFG")
        retTotal = retTotal + count
    if retRootDomains.len != retTotal ||
       retRootRows.len != retTotal ||
       retRootTypeIds.len != retTotal ||
       retFormalTypeIds.len != retTotal:
        panic("exact def call authority: contract derive RET window invalid")
    for row in 0..<functionCount:
        let exprClass = resultExprClasses[row]
        var rootKind = exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootUnknownTag
        var formalIndex: int32 = -1
        var formalMask: int32
        var globalRow: int32 = -1
        var readOnlyProof = exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractReadOnlyUnknownTag
        if exprClass == exactDefCallAuthorityExprClassOwned ||
           exprClass == exactDefCallAuthorityExprClassUnmanaged:
            # OWNED 门 (§4.2-2): 五槽必须全 UNKNOWN/-1/0/-1/UNKNOWN。
            if expectRootKinds[row] !=
                   exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootUnknownTag ||
               expectFormalIndexs[row] != -1 ||
               expectFormalMasks[row] != 0 ||
               expectGlobalRows[row] != -1 ||
               expectReadOnlyProofs[row] !=
                   exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractReadOnlyUnknownTag:
                exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                    phase, row, "owned result carries borrow-root metadata")
        elif exprClass == exactDefCallAuthorityExprClassBorrowed:
            let start = retStarts[row]
            let count = retCounts[row]
            if count <= 0:
                exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                    phase, row, "borrowed function has no reachable RET")
            var sawStatic = false
            var dynamicKind =
                exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootUnknownTag
            for retIndex in start..<start + count:
                let domain = retRootDomains[retIndex]
                if domain == exactDefCallAuthorityRetRootStatic:
                    sawStatic = true
                    continue
                if domain == exactDefCallAuthorityRetRootSentinel:
                    exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                        phase, row,
                        "managed borrowed RET sentinel is not exact nil")
                if domain != exactDefCallAuthorityRetRootFormal &&
                   domain != exactDefCallAuthorityRetRootGlobal:
                    exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                        phase, row,
                        "canonical borrow root is not a formal or global")
                if retRootRows[retIndex] < 0:
                    exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                        phase, row,
                        "reachable RET canonical root is missing")
                if domain == exactDefCallAuthorityRetRootFormal:
                    let formal = retRootRows[retIndex]
                    if dynamicKind ==
                           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootGlobalTag ||
                       formal >= formalCounts[row] || formal >= 32 ||
                       retRootTypeIds[retIndex] < 0 ||
                       retRootTypeIds[retIndex] !=
                           retFormalTypeIds[retIndex]:
                        exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                            phase, row,
                            "formal borrow root identity is invalid")
                    dynamicKind =
                        exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootFormalTag
                    formalMask = formalMask | (1 << formal)
                else:
                    let global = retRootRows[retIndex]
                    if dynamicKind ==
                           exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootFormalTag ||
                       global >= globalTypeIds.len ||
                       retRootTypeIds[retIndex] < 0 ||
                       retRootTypeIds[retIndex] !=
                           globalTypeIds[global] ||
                       (globalRow >= 0 && globalRow != global):
                        exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                            phase, row,
                            "global borrow roots are inconsistent")
                    dynamicKind =
                        exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootGlobalTag
                    globalRow = global
            if dynamicKind ==
                   exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootUnknownTag:
                if !sawStatic:
                    exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                        phase, row, "borrowed function has no return root")
                rootKind = exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootStaticTag
            elif dynamicKind ==
                     exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootFormalTag:
                if formalMask == 0:
                    exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                        phase, row, "formal root set is empty")
                if !formalRootsReadOnly[row]:
                    exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                        phase, row, "formal borrow root is not read-only")
                rootKind = exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootFormalTag
                readOnlyProof =
                    exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractReadOnlyProvenTag
                var bit: int32
                while bit < 32:
                    if (formalMask & (1 << bit)) != 0:
                        formalIndex = bit
                        break
                    bit = bit + 1
            else:
                rootKind = exactdef.BodyIrExactDefContractRootGlobalTag
        else:
            exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                phase, row, "result ownership summary is invalid")
        # 快照窗恒等校验 (§4.2-7; 只发布独立推导的元组)。
        if rootKind != expectRootKinds[row] ||
           formalIndex != expectFormalIndexs[row] ||
           formalMask != expectFormalMasks[row] ||
           globalRow != expectGlobalRows[row] ||
           readOnlyProof != expectReadOnlyProofs[row]:
            exactDefCallAuthorityContractReject(
                phase, row,
                "serialized borrow-result five-tuple does not recompute")
        add(contract.rootKinds, rootKind)
        add(contract.formalIndexs, formalIndex)
        add(contract.formalMasks, formalMask)
        add(contract.globalRows, globalRow)
        add(contract.readOnlyProofs, readOnlyProof)
    ExactDefCallAuthorityContractSealInto(contract)

# ---- 相位与组合入口 (规格 §6 组合序) ----

# 批 5 相位本体: seal/canonical 不变量扫描 (panic 域) → 单遍主循环
# (MV 行分类器 / CallOp 三族分派 / FieldStore+IndexedStore 墙3 爬
# 升)。MV 行判词 = 分类器详判 + 主审 MV 臂包装判词 (cheng_cold.c:
# 68841 同序两行)。
# 生产 seal 接线 (规格 §4.5): contract = 程序契约表 (canonical empty =
# 无表合法态, var root 臂停用, W8 臂合取仍全量适用 — 批 5 REPORT §5
# 非降级口径); calleeRows = 每 callSequence 行 callee TypedExpr 函数
# 行窗 (键车道: semanticCallExprNodeIndex→callDeclaration 投影, -1 =
# importc/合成), 空窗 = 臂停用。@borrows: 契约表按借用绑定 (生产侧
# 模块级缓存的全局存储值不得 move/share, 按值只读送达即隐式借用)。
@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityPhaseValidateInto(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        phase: str,
        contract: exactdef.ExactProgramContract,
        calleeRows: int32[]): bool =
    if !bodyIR.exactDef.sealed:
        panic("exact def call authority: validate requires sealed sidecar")
    if !exactdef.BodyIrExactDefSidecarShapeValid(bodyIR):
        panic("exact def call authority: sidecar shape invalid")
    let contractActive =
        !ExactDefCallAuthorityContractIsCanonicalEmpty(contract)
    if contractActive && !ExactDefCallAuthorityContractShapeValid(contract):
        panic("exact def call authority: contract shape invalid")
    if calleeRows.len != 0 && calleeRows.len != bodyIR.callSequence.len:
        panic("exact def call authority: contract callee window invalid")
    if !contractActive && calleeRows.len != 0:
        panic("exact def call authority: contract callee window without table")
    if contractActive && bodyIR.callSequence.len != 0 &&
       calleeRows.len == 0:
        panic("exact def call authority: contract callee window missing")
    exactDefCallAuthoritySealRootInvariantScan(bodyIR)
    var dom = freeze.ExactDefFreezeDominatorsBuild(bodyIR)
    var workspace = freeze.ExactDefFreezeIdentityWorkspaceAcquire(bodyIR)
    for opRow in 0..<bodyIR.ops.len:
        let op = bodyIR.ops[opRow]
        if op.valueDefSlot >= 0 &&
           bodyIR.exactDef.opPlaceKinds[opRow] ==
               exactdef.BodyIrExactDefPlaceMemoryVersionTag:
            if !exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutDefinitionValid(
                   bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, phase, opRow):
                var site: ExactDefCallAuthorityVarOutSite
                site.definition = opRow
                site.valueSlot = op.valueDefSlot
                site.callOp = -1
                site.callRow = -1
                site.param = -1
                site.argRow = -1
                site.carrier = -1
                site.publicationCarrier = -1
                site.source = -1
                site.form = ExactDefCallAuthorityFormNone
                let _ = exactDefCallAuthorityVarOutRecover(
                    bodyIR, workspace.opBlockIds, opRow, site)
                exactDefCallAuthorityVerdictEmit(
                    exactDefCallAuthorityMemoryVersionBrokenLine(
                        phase, bodyIR.controlFunctionRow, opRow,
                        site.callOp, site.param, site.carrier))
                return false
        if op.kind == coreir.BodyOpCallTag && op.operands.len == 1:
            exactDefCallAuthorityCallValid(
                bodyIR, dom, workspace, limits, opRow,
                contract, contractActive, calleeRows)
        if op.kind == coreir.BodyOpFieldStoreTag ||
           op.kind == coreir.BodyOpIndexedStoreTag:
            exactDefCallAuthorityIndexedStoreValid(
                bodyIR, dom, workspace, opRow)
    return true

# 组合入口 (批 4 组合序同款): 批 2 相位 → 批 4 merge 校验 → 批 5 相
# 位 → 批 3 主审; phase 统一 "freeze" (与各批组合点同铭文)。两后端
# 生产挂接点 (primary_object_plan/backend2_pipeline) 同口径; contract
# /calleeRows 为程序契约生产 seal 接线窗 (canonical empty + 空窗 =
# 臂停用合法态)。@borrows: 契约表按借用绑定 (模块级缓存的全局存
# 储值不得 move/share, 生产侧按值只读送达即隐式借用)。
@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityValidateInto(
        bodyIR: var coreir.BodyIR,
        limits: freeze.ExactDefFreezeLimits,
        contract: exactdef.ExactProgramContract,
        calleeRows: int32[]): bool =
    if !freeze.ExactDefFreezeValidateInto(bodyIR, limits):
        return false
    if !exactdefmerge.ExactDefMergeValidateInto(bodyIR, limits):
        return false
    if !ExactDefCallAuthorityPhaseValidateInto(bodyIR, limits, "freeze",
                                               contract, calleeRows):
        return false
    return identity.ExactDefIdentityPhaseValidateInto(bodyIR, limits,
                                                      "freeze")

# ---- 夹具专用判词文本出口 (unit 文本断言; 批 2-4 同例) ----

@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityTestIndexStructureLine(
        definition: int32,
        call: int32,
        carrier: int32,
        slot: int32,
        ckind: int32,
        cdst: int32,
        ca: int32,
        csrc: int32): str =
    return exactDefCallAuthorityIndexStructureLine(
        definition, call, carrier, slot, ckind, cdst, ca, csrc)

@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityTestMismatchLine(
        definition: int32,
        source: int32,
        callArg: int32,
        formal: int32,
        valueSlot: int32,
        exactType: int32,
        storage: int32,
        sentinel: int32,
        sourceMatch: int32): str =
    return exactDefCallAuthorityMismatchLine(
        definition, source, callArg, formal, valueSlot, exactType,
        storage, sentinel, sourceMatch)

@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityTestMemoryVersionBrokenLine(phase: str,
                                                    functionRow: int32,
                                                    opRow: int32,
                                                    call: int32,
                                                    formal: int32,
                                                    carrier: int32): str =
    return exactDefCallAuthorityMemoryVersionBrokenLine(
        phase, functionRow, opRow, call, formal, carrier)

@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityTestContractRejectLine(phase: str,
                                               functionRow: int32,
                                               reason: str): str =
    return exactDefCallAuthorityContractRejectLine(phase, functionRow,
                                                   reason)

@borrows
fn ExactDefCallAuthorityTestStrSeqLiteralOwnershipLine(body: int32,
                                                       element: int32,
                                                       def: int32,
                                                       ownership: int32,
                                                       place: int32,
                                                       origin: int32,
                                                       kind: int32,
                                                       slot: int32,
                                                       source: int32,
                                                       opA: int32,
                                                       opB: int32,
                                                       opC: int32): str =
    return exactDefCallAuthorityStrSeqLiteralOwnershipLine(
        body, element, def, ownership, place, origin, kind, slot,
        source, opA, opB, opC)
